        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 28.77,
          "end": 31.17,
          "en": "Now, basically there's a concept of tree.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 31.17,
          "end": 33.63,
          "en": "I mean something like a real life tree, which we have.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 33.63,
          "end": 36.3,
          "en": "So in this you have a root, you have a branch,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 36.3,
          "end": 38.88,
          "en": "and you have leaf or leaves.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 38.88,
          "end": 41.76,
          "en": "So we can do the same thing in data structure.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 41.76,
          "end": 44.07,
          "en": "So basically what we have is concept of tree.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 44.07,
          "end": 46.8,
          "en": "So what we do is we basically create different nodes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 46.8,
          "end": 48.87,
          "en": "or nodes with tree structure.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 48.87,
          "end": 50.94,
          "en": "So something like this, we have a node here.",
