        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 50.94,
          "end": 52.68,
          "en": "Let's say this is node A,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 52.68,
          "end": 56.34,
          "en": "and then this particular node will have sub nodes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 56.34,
          "end": 57.81,
          "en": "or we can say child nodes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 57.81,
          "end": 59.13,
          "en": "So here we can have another node,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 59.13,
          "end": 60.6,
          "en": "here we can have another node.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 60.6,
          "end": 61.59,
          "en": "Again, a node.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 61.59,
          "end": 64.05,
          "en": "And even this can have different nodes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 64.05,
          "end": 66.3,
          "en": "One or many or zero doesn't matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 66.3,
          "end": 69.06,
          "en": "So this is how restructure looks like.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 69.06,
          "end": 70.38,
          "en": "So you can have values as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 70.38,
          "end": 72.63,
          "en": "So let's say instead of A, I have value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 72.63,
          "end": 77.63,
          "en": "which is 5, 6, 8, 2, 1, 8 again and 3.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 79.17,
          "end": 81.45,
          "en": "Now this is a tree structure, okay?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 81.45,
          "end": 83.13,
