          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 114.57,
          "end": 116.31,
          "en": "is your root node.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 116.31,
          "end": 117.53999999999999,
          "en": "So we have one more concept",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 117.53999999999999,
          "end": 120,
          "en": "or two more concepts here, which is parent and child.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 120,
          "end": 121.62,
          "en": "So example, we have a node here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 121.62,
          "end": 126.36,
          "en": "Now this B is actually a child of A, okay?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 126.36,
          "end": 129.06,
          "en": "Same goes for C, C's also child of A.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 129.06,
          "end": 132.63,
          "en": "And of course, by doing this, we are saying A is a parent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 132.63,
          "end": 133.8,
          "en": "I mean, it's almost similar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 133.8,
          "end": 135.72,
          "en": "to your family tree, which you create.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 135.72,
          "end": 138.3,
          "en": "We have grandparents, then we have our parents,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 138.3,
          "end": 139.59,
          "en": "and then the leaves goes on, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 139.59,
          "end": 141.15,
          "en": "So same goes here, we have a parent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 141.15,
          "end": 142.38,
          "en": "and then we have a child here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 142.38,
          "end": 145.07999999999998,
          "en": "So every node will have a parent, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
