          "en": "So if you talk about B, the parent of B is A.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 152.01,
          "end": 153.21,
          "en": "But what about A?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 153.21,
          "end": 154.35,
